#### MED-2 — No CORS Policy (OWASP A05 / CWE-942)

No CORS headers are set. This either blocks legitimate browser clients or, if a developer adds a wildcard `Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *` as a quick fix, opens the API to cross-origin abuse.

**Fix — configure CORS explicitly:**

```js
