**Severity: Medium**

User data is hardcoded in the route handler. In a real expansion of this app, developers may be tempted to interpolate user-controlled input directly into database queries, leading to **SQL/NoSQL injection**.

**Recommendation:** When a real data layer is added, always use parameterized queries — never string concatenation:

```js
