## 🚨 Finding 8 — No Structured Error Handling / Information Leakage (OWASP A09)

**Severity: Medium**

There is no global error handler. Unhandled errors in Express will expose full stack traces to clients in development, and produce inconsistent error shapes in production.

**Recommendation:** Add a centralized error handler as the last middleware:

```js
