### 🟠 HIGH — Missing Security Headers (OWASP A05)

**Finding:** No security headers are set. Responses are missing `Content-Security-Policy`, `X-Frame-Options`, `X-Content-Type-Options`, `Referrer-Policy`, etc.

**Recommendation:**
```js
const helmet = require('helmet');
app.use(helmet({
  contentSecurityPolicy: {
    directives: {
      defaultSrc: ["'self'"],
      scriptSrc:  ["'self'"],
    },
