### 🟡 MEDIUM — No CORS Policy (OWASP A05)

**Finding:** No CORS headers are configured. Depending on deployment, this either locks out legitimate web clients or (in some frameworks) defaults to wide-open.

**Recommendation:**
```js
const cors = require('cors');

app.use(cors({
  origin: process.env.ALLOWED_ORIGINS?.split(',') ?? [], // e.g. "https://app.example.com"
  methods: ['GET', 'POST', 'PUT', 'DELETE'],
