```

---

### 🟡 MEDIUM — No Graceful Error Handling (Information Leakage) (OWASP A05)

**Finding:** No global error handler exists. Unhandled exceptions in Express will return full stack traces in development mode and crash the process in production.

**Recommendation:**
```js
