```

**Fix:** Keep health responses minimal and place them behind internal network controls or a separate port:

```js
// ✅ Minimal public health check
app.get('/health', (req, res) => {
  res.status(200).json({ status: 'ok' }); // no timestamp, no version, no internals
});
```

