## 📋 Summary Table

| # | Severity | Finding | OWASP | Fix |
|---|----------|---------|-------|-----|
| 1 | 🔴 High | No authentication on `/users` | A01, A07 | JWT middleware |
| 2 | 🔴 High | No input validation | A03 | `express-validator` |
| 3 | 🔴 High | No security headers | A05 | `helmet` |
| 4 | 🟠 Med | `X-Powered-By` leaks stack info | A05 | `app.disable(...)` |
| 5 | 🟠 Med | No rate limiting | A04 | `express-rate-limit` |
| 6 | 🟠 Med | No response field filtering | A02 | Serializer function |
| 7 | 🟠 Med | No CORS policy | A05 | `cors` with allowlist |
| 8 | 🟡 Low | No centralized error handler | A05 | Error middleware |
| 9 | 🟡 Low | No request body size limit | A04 | `express.json` limit |
| 10 | 🟡 Low | Health endpoint leaks timestamp | A05 | Remove or gate it |

